        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl text-ink font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Why Easy Todo List Is the Best Todo List App for You</h3>
        <p>
          We've built this <strong>todo list website</strong> with one core principle: simplicity. Your data stays in your browser – private, secure, and under your control. No servers storing your personal information, no accounts to hack, no subscriptions to manage. When you use our <strong>online todo list</strong>, you own your data completely.
        </p>

